Project: 256-bit Bitset
Description: Bitset over [8]i32 (256 bits), bit manipulation operations
Operations: bset, bclear, btest, bcount
Test:
  Set bits 0, 7, 63, 127, 255
  Test all 5 bits -> expect 1 (set)
  Test bit 1 -> expect 0 (not set)
  Count set bits -> expect 5
  Clear bits 0 and 63
  Test bit 0 -> expect 0 (cleared)
  Count set bits -> expect 3
Expected exit code: 0
